          "id": "17fc989d-639f-4d36-8507-7a1e90589286",
          "markdown": "# Metrics - Ingest \u0026 Process usage\nUsage can be broken down into 3 categories:\n* fullstack: metrics sent from a source with OneAgent running in [Full-Stack Monitoring](https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/shortlink/dps-hosts#full-stack-metrics)\n* infrastructure: metrics sent from a source with OneAgent running in [Infrastructure Monitoring](https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/shortlink/dps-hosts#infra-mon-metrics)\n* other: metrics coming from other sources (cloud, remote extensions and more)\n\nUsage collection is delayed by 4 hours, usage queries should always be at least 4 hours in the part otherwise no usage will be shown",
          "type": "markdown"
        },
